    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there's help but it feels so empty. like, it’s not just sadness, it’s that everything is fundamentally broken. if the thing that gave me purpose and structure was a lie, then everything i am is built on nothing. how do you even find a reason to exist when you realize the whole foundation was fake? it feels more like a logical dead end than a feeling.",
